  "description": "Basic questions check (Phase 10): everyday questions about every domain, sent to the running web API as a visitor would. Not a script to rehearse: a miss points to a general cause to fix (a missing fact in the indexed documents, a routing rule), never to a per-question patch. Each one has the domain that should answer it and words of which at least one must appear in the answer (lowercase, accents ignored); 'not_found' ones must be refused. Questions with the same 'session' are one conversation (the agent's memory). Run: make demo-check. 'domain' may be a list (any of them is right). 'agent_only': a follow-up that needs the conversation, skipped with --direct (the direct flow has no memory).",
